</svg></a><a data-slot="sidebar-item" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring" href="#card">Card</a><a data-slot="sidebar-item" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring" href="#dialog">Dialog</a><a data-slot="sidebar-item" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring" href="#data-table">Data table</a></div><div data-slot="sidebar-group" class="grid gap-1 py-2"><div data-slot="sidebar-group-label" class="px-2 py-1 text-[11px] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Guides</div><a data-slot="sidebar-item" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring" href="#theming"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-file-text" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z"></path><path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5"></path><path d="M10 9H8"></path><path d="M16 13H8"></path><path d="M16 17H8"></path></svg> Theming</a><a data-slot="sidebar-item" class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md px-2 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring" href="#accessibility">Accessibility</a></div></nav><article class="min-w-0"><nav data-slot="breadcrumb" aria-label="breadcrumb" class="w-full"><ol data-slot="breadcrumb-list" class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 break-words text-sm text-muted-foreground sm:gap-2"><li data-slot="breadcrumb-item" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a data-slot="breadcrumb-link" class="rounded-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:text-foreground focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50" href="#">Docs</a></li><li data-slot="breadcrumb-separator" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li data-slot="breadcrumb-item" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><a data-slot="breadcrumb-link" class="rounded-sm outline-none transition-colors hover:text-foreground focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50" href="#">Getting started</a></li><li data-slot="breadcrumb-separator" role="presentation" aria-hidden="true" class="[&amp;&gt;svg]:size-3.5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></li><li data-slot="breadcrumb-item" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5"><span data-slot="breadcrumb-page" role="link" aria-disabled="true" aria-current="page" class="font-normal text-foreground">Installation</span></li></ol></nav><h1 id="introduction" class="mt-4 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Installation</h1><p class="mt-3 text-muted-foreground">Veil UI is a copy-paste registry. Components are added to your project as source files, so you can change anything without waiting for an upstream release.</p><div data-slot="alert" data-variant="default" role="alert" class="relative flex w-full items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-sm [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:translate-y-0.5 bg-card text-card-foreground [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-muted-foreground mt-5"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-info" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 16v-4"></path><path d="M12 8h.01"></path></svg><div data-slot="alert-title" class="font-medium tracking-tight">Requirements</div><div data-slot="alert-description" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed">React 19, Tailwind CSS v4 and a package manager. The CLI works with pnpm, npm, yarn and bun.</div></div><h2 id="installation" class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Add components</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Run the CLI from your project root. It detects your components directory and writes files with the correct imports.</p><figure data-slot="code-block" class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-muted/40 mt-4"><figcaption class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b px-3 py-1.5"><span class="truncate font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">Terminal</span><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="rounded-sm p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></figcaption><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed"><code class="font-mono">pnpm dlx veil-ui add button card dialog
# or with npm
npx veil-ui add button card dialog</code></pre></figure><h2 id="usage" class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Use a component</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Import from your local UI folder. There is no runtime package to install.</p><figure data-slot="code-block" class="overflow-hidden rounded-lg border bg-muted/40 mt-4"><figcaption class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b px-3 py-1.5"><span class="truncate font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground">app/page.tsx</span><button type="button" aria-label="Copy code" class="rounded-sm p-1 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-copy size-3.5" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="14" x="8" y="8" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2"></path></svg></button></figcaption><pre class="overflow-x-auto p-4 text-sm leading-relaxed"><code class="font-mono">import { Button } from &quot;@/components/ui/button&quot;;
export function Example() {
  return (
    &lt;Button variant=&quot;outline&quot; size=&quot;sm&quot;&gt;
      Save changes
    &lt;/Button&gt;
  );
}</code></pre></figure><h2 id="configuration" class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Configuration</h2><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">The generated <code class="rounded bg-muted px-1 py-0.5 text-xs">components.json</code> file tells the CLI where to place components, utilities and hooks.</p><div data-slot="alert" data-variant="destructive" role="alert" class="relative flex w-full items-start gap-3 rounded-lg border px-4 py-3 text-sm [&amp;&gt;svg]:size-4 [&amp;&gt;svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;&gt;svg]:translate-y-0.5 border-destructive/35 bg-destructive/5 text-destructive [&amp;&gt;svg]:text-destructive mt-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-triangle-alert lucide-alert-triangle" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3"></path><path d="M12 9v4"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg><div data-slot="alert-title" class="font-medium tracking-tight">Do not edit generated files by hand</div><div data-slot="alert-description" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground [&amp;_p]:leading-relaxed">Changes will be overwritten the next time you add a component. Extend components in your own wrapper instead.</div></div><div class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t pt-5 text-sm"><button data-slot="button" data-variant="ghost" data-size="sm" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap font-medium outline-none transition-[color,background-color,border-color,box-shadow] focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-[3px] focus-visible:ring-ring/50 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-f